About this project-Karma store:

This project is a static website for a wifi company,

The project was built with HTML and CSS and deployed with Netlify.

#Project entity
This project was created for this following entities
*Place order for your wifi
*To be able to choose between the following color when ordering your wifi,orange and grey.
*To be able to collect the user information attribute
*First name
*Last name
*E-mail address
*address
*City
*Postcode

#Challenges faced
*I had problems styling the store, since it was first time using css grid
*I faced some Challenges with the Media query.

